---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Services — CMX Labs | Web Apps, SaaS, Mobile & Custom Software"
  description="CMX Labs builds web applications, SaaS platforms, mobile apps, custom software, and e-commerce solutions for businesses in Curaçao and internationally."
>

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-label="Services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">What We Build</div>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">
        The right tools<br /><em class="hero-accent">for your business.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">
        We design and build digital products across a wide range of categories — from simple business websites to complex SaaS platforms and mobile applications.
      </p>
      <div class="page-hero-ctas">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl btn-magnetic">Start a project &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/work"    class="btn btn-ghost  btn-xl">See our work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES GRID -->
  <section class="services-page section" aria-label="Services overview">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header sr">
        <div class="section-label">Core services</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything from<br />strategy to launch.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-grid">

        <!-- Product Design & Development -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-wide bento-purple sr">
          <div class="bento-num">01</div>
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="bento-title">Product Design &amp; Development</h2>
          <p class="bento-desc">End-to-end digital product development. We handle UI/UX design, frontend, backend, database, and deployment. From wireframe to live product, in one team.</p>
          <div class="bento-chips"><span>Web apps</span><span>SaaS</span><span>Mobile</span><span>E-commerce</span><span>Platforms</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stack -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-accent-card sr">
          <div class="bento-accent-label">Our stack</div>
          <div class="bento-stack-chips">
            <span>React</span><span>Next.js</span><span>TypeScript</span>
            <span>Supabase</span><span>Stripe</span><span>Vercel</span>
            <span>Node.js</span><span>Figma</span><span>Tailwind</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-accent-footer">Modern. Proven. Scalable.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-teal sr">
          <div class="bento-num">02</div>
          <div class="bento-icon bento-icon-teal" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="bento-title">Mobile App Development</h2>
          <p class="bento-desc">Cross-platform mobile apps built with React Native. One codebase, iOS and Android. From consumer apps to internal tools.</p>
          <div class="bento-chips"><span>iOS</span><span>Android</span><span>React Native</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Custom Software -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-orange sr">
          <div class="bento-num">03</div>
          <div class="bento-icon bento-icon-orange" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="bento-title">Custom Software &amp; Automation</h2>
          <p class="bento-desc">Business-specific tools, internal dashboards, and workflow automations. APIs and integrations that connect your systems and save real time.</p>
          <div class="bento-chips"><span>Dashboards</span><span>APIs</span><span>Automations</span><span>Integrations</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- E-commerce -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-purple sr">
          <div class="bento-num">04</div>
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"/><path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="bento-title">E-commerce &amp; Online Stores</h2>
          <p class="bento-desc">Custom e-commerce experiences with payment integration, inventory management, and optimized checkout flows that convert.</p>
          <div class="bento-chips"><span>Stripe</span><span>Payments</span><span>Inventory</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- UI/UX Design -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-teal sr">
          <div class="bento-num">05</div>
          <div class="bento-icon bento-icon-teal" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20A10 10 0 0 0 12 2z"/><path d="M12 6v2"/><path d="M12 16v2"/><path d="M6 12H4"/><path d="M20 12h-2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="bento-title">UI/UX &amp; Product Design</h2>
          <p class="bento-desc">Research, wireframes, and high-fidelity UI. We design interfaces that are beautiful, intuitive, and built on real user needs — not assumptions.</p>
          <div class="bento-chips"><span>Figma</span><span>Wireframes</span><span>Prototypes</span><span>Design systems</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Strategy + Analytics -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-wide bento-orange sr">
          <div class="bento-num">06</div>
          <div class="bento-icon bento-icon-orange" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="bento-title">Strategy, Analytics &amp; Growth</h2>
          <p class="bento-desc">Beyond the build. We help you measure what matters, understand your users, and build a digital presence that grows your business. SEO, performance monitoring, and strategic roadmapping included.</p>
          <div class="bento-chips"><span>Analytics</span><span>SEO</span><span>Strategy</span><span>Growth</span><span>Roadmapping</span></div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROCESS TEASER -->
  <section class="section process-section" id="process" aria-labelledby="services-process-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header sr">
        <div class="section-label">Our process</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="services-process-title">
          Four steps.<br />One live product.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Every project, regardless of size or complexity, follows the same proven path to launch.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step sr">
          <div class="process-step-num">01</div>
          <div class="process-icon process-icon-purple" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-step-title">Discover</h3>
          <p class="process-step-desc">We dig into your business, your users, and the specific problem worth solving. Scoping, research, and a clear project plan before we write a line of code.</p>
          <div class="process-step-chips"><span>Research</span><span>Scoping</span><span>Strategy</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step sr">
          <div class="process-step-num">02</div>
          <div class="process-icon process-icon-teal" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-step-title">Design</h3>
          <p class="process-step-desc">Wireframes to high-fidelity UI, designed for your users and your brand. We prototype early and refine fast.</p>
          <div class="process-step-chips"><span>Wireframes</span><span>UI&nbsp;/&nbsp;UX</span><span>Prototypes</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step sr">
          <div class="process-step-num">03</div>
          <div class="process-icon process-icon-orange" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-step-title">Build</h3>
          <p class="process-step-desc">Clean code, modern stack, no shortcuts. We build in milestones, test continuously, and keep you updated every step of the way.</p>
          <div class="process-step-chips"><span>Development</span><span>Testing</span><span>Iteration</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step sr">
          <div class="process-step-num">04</div>
          <div class="process-icon process-icon-launch" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"/><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-step-title">Launch</h3>
          <p class="process-step-desc">Deployment, monitoring, and a smooth handover. We don&rsquo;t disappear at launch — we&rsquo;re available for support, maintenance, and what&rsquo;s next.</p>
          <div class="process-step-chips"><span>Deploy</span><span>Monitor</span><span>Support</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="final-cta" aria-label="Start a project">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="final-cta-inner sr">
        <div class="section-label">Ready to start?</div>
        <h2 class="final-cta-title">Let&rsquo;s build<br />your product.</h2>
        <p class="final-cta-sub">
          Tell us what you need. We&rsquo;ll scope it, price it fairly, and get to work.
        </p>
        <div class="final-cta-btns">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl btn-magnetic">Start a project &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/work"    class="btn btn-ghost  btn-xl">See our work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
